setup (cla: yes, waiting for tree to go green)\n\n20980 Avoid crashing and display error if the process cannot be prepared for JIT mode Dart VM. (cla: yes, platform-ios)\n\n20983 Don't use GetTaskQueueId() in rasterizer as it breaks Fuchsia (cla: yes, waiting for tree to go green)\n\n20984 fuchsia: Compile disabled RasterThreadMerger code (affects: tests, cla: yes, platform-fuchsia, waiting for tree to go green)\n\n20986 Update test Dart code to pass the latest Dart analyzer rules (cla: yes)\n\n20991 Tweak the mdns error message (cla: yes, platform-ios)\n\n21001 Don't use GetTaskQueueId() in rasterizer as it breaks Fuchsia (#20983) (cla: yes)\n\n21010 Update web lerpDouble to match C++ behaviour (cla: yes)\n\n21025 Update Android SDK to 30r3 (cla: yes, platform-android)\n\n21029 Fixed ios layout change to not refocus semantics object if the focus … (cla: yes, platform-ios)\n\n21043 Revert \"Enable lazy-async-stacks by-default in all modes (Take 3)\" (cla: yes)\n\n21046 Check for dart2js on felt startup (cla: yes)\n\n21049 Adds increment/decrement actions to fuchsia accessibility bridge. (cla: yes)\n\n21050 Open a fresh dir during LoadSkSLs (cla: yes)\n\n21058 Rename Registrar to PluginRegistrar in Win/GLFW C API (cla: yes, waiting for tree to go green)\n\n21060 Cherrypick Dart 5e8b31a5fa48 (cla: yes)\n\n21061 Remove the type parameter from SkObjectFinalizationRegistry. (cla: yes, waiting for tree to go green)\n\n21069 Add missing  header (cla: yes)\n\n21075 Disable a flaky Scenarios test (cla: yes)\nMerged PRs in flutter/plugins from 2020-07-09T05:19:00.000 to 2020-09-10T18:17:00.000\nThere were 65 pull requests.\n\n970 [share] Add sharing file support (android & ios) (cla: yes, in review)\n\n2824 [google_sign_in] Bridge google_sign_in and googleapis. (cla: yes)\n\n2845 [path_provider] Use the application ID in the application support path (cla: yes)\n\n2848 [camera] Improving handling when camera permissions are not granted. (cla: yes)\n\n2866 [e2e] Fix incorrect test results when one test passes then another fails (cla: yes)\n\n2869 [connectivity_for_web] Fix JS Interop in release mode. (cla: yes)\n\n2872 [in_app_purchase] Fix the bug that prevent restored subscription transactions from being completed (cla: yes)\n\n2873 [e2e] add support to report extra information (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2889 Make package:e2e a relative reference (cla: yes)\n\n2896 Revert \"[path_provider] Use the application ID in the application support path\" (cla: yes)\n\n2898 Clarify e2e readme for running on firebase test lab (cla: yes)\n\n2902 [in_app_purchases] Fixed typo 'manuelly' for 'manually' (cla: yes)\n\n2903 [google_maps_flutter(_platform_interface)] Make the plugin friendlier to the web implementation. (cla: yes)\n\n2904 [web] Adding capability to e2e to take screenshot for web tests. (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2906 [e2e] Add new e2e_driver for handling response data and performance watcher (waiting for test harness)\n\n2908 [google_maps_flutter_platform_interface] Add dispose method. ()\n\n2909 [google_maps_flutter] Call platform.dispose on GoogleMap widget dispose. (cla: yes)\n\n2915 [e2e] Update code onwer. (cla: yes)\n\n2917 [e2e] revert performance tracker utilities (waiting for test harness)\n\n2918 Rename e2e -> integration_test (cla: yes)\n\n2921 Add README instructions for enablePendingPurchases (cla: yes)\n\n2922 [video_player] Set audio mix options (cla: yes)\n\n2923 [device_info] Changed directory of device_info (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2924 [google_maps_flutter] Pin GoogleMaps cocoapod dep to last good known version (cla: yes)\n\n2927 [video_player_platform_interface] Add interface changes for audio mix mode (cla: yes)\n\n2928 Fix unguarded availability in Camera plugin (cla: yes)\n\n2929 [device_info] Platform interface added in device_info (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2932 fixed url_launcher link in url_launcher_web README  (cla: yes)\n\n2933 [google_maps_flutter_web] First version of the plugin. (cla: yes)\n\n2934 [versions] increase package:platform constraint (cla: yes)\n\n2936 MORE SHARDS MEANS MORE CI (cla: yes)\n\n2938 Revert \"[video_player] Set audio mix options (#2922)\" (cla: yes)\n\n2939 Reland \"[video_player] Set audio mix options (#2922)\" (cla: yes)\n\n2942 [device_info] Port device_info to use platform interface (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2944 [battery] Updated README.md (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2945 [google_maps_flutter_web] Port e2e tests to integration_test package. (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2947 [integration_test] add support to get timeline (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2948 [android_intent] fix platform package dep (cla: yes)\n\n2950 [shared_preferences_linux] update file package dep version to be compatible with framework (cla: yes)\n\n2955 [image_picker] Updating documentation to use isEmpty check. (cla: yes)\n\n2956 [integration_test] Minor cleanup (cla: yes)\n\n2959 [path_provider, video_player] Tweak pubspecs to pass bulk analysis. (cla: yes)\n\n2963 [integration_test] Remove debugging statement (cla: yes)\n\n2964 Geodesic Polyline support in iOS (cla: yes)\n\n2966 Rebase previous commits (cla: yes)\n\n2967 [integration_test] Show stack trace of widget test errors on the platform side (cla: yes)\n\n2968 [video_player_platform_interface] fix setMixIWithOthers test channel (cla: yes)\n\n2969 [battery] Moved battery to subdir (cla: yes)\n\n2970 [video_player] Fix setWithOthers test (cla: yes)\n\n2972 [integration_test] Fix channel name for iOS, docs (cla: yes)\n\n2974 [url_launcher_platform_interface] Add webOnlyWindowName parameter to launch() (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2975 [battery_platform_interface] Introduce package. (cla: yes)\n\n2977 [flutter_plugin_android_lifecycle] add no-op v2 plugin (cla: yes)\n\n2979 [url_launcher]Added webOnlyWindowName parameter to launch()  (cla: yes)\n\n2980 [battery] Port battery to use platform interface (cla: yes)\n\n2984 [url_launcher, url_launcher_web] Fix API dependencies. (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2985 [google_maps_flutter] Fix Android unit test. (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n2989 Support Windows in incremental_build.sh (cla: yes)\n\n2992 Standardize LICENSE body text formatting (cla: yes)\n\n2993 Add LUCI try builders json config file (cla: yes)\n\n3006 [device_info_platform_interface] Typo in doc fixed (cla: yes)\n\n3007 [image_picker_for_web] Can't select some video file types (3gp, mp4, possibly others...) (cla: yes)\n\n3008 [url_launcher] Suppress deprecation warning in WebViewActivity (cla: yes)\n\n3010 [url_launcher_web] Fix a typo in a test name and fix quote consistency (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)\n\n3011 [google_maps_flutter] Fix typo in google_maps_flutter/example/map_ui.dart (cla: yes)",
