        title: "Release Notes 3.27.0",
        body: "title: Flutter 3.27.0 release notes\nshortTitle: 3.27.0 release notes\ndescription: Release notes for Flutter 3.27.0.\nskipTemplateRendering: true\n\nThis page has release notes for 3.27.0.\nFor information about subsequent bug-fix releases,\ncheck out the Flutter [CHANGELOG][].\nFlutter framework\nFramework\n\n Add example of goldenFileComparator usage in widget tests by @alestiago in 150422\n content dimensions are not established get controller value error by @hello-coder-xu in 148938\n Fix link in tree hygene doc by @derdilla in 151235\n Fix references in examples by @goderbauer in 151204\n Feat: Add withOpacity to gradient by @rkishan516 in 150670\n SliverFloatingHeader by @HansMuller in 151145\n Update deprecation policy by @Piinks in 151257\n PinnedHeaderSliver example based on the iOS Settings AppBar by @HansMuller in 151205\n Add a message about spam/brigading by @nate-thegrate in 150583\n Prepares semantics_update_test for upcoming link URL change by @harryterkelsen in 151261\n Cupertino transparent navigation bars by @veloce in 149102\n Add tests for color_filtered.0.dart example. by @ksokolovskyi in 151064\n Add tests for action_listener.0.dart by @ValentinVignal in 150606\n Update doc-import to primary configured import, goldens_io.dart by @srawlins in 151390\nFactor out deprecated names in example code by @nate-thegrate in 151374\nAdded SliverFloatingHeader.snapMode by @HansMuller in 151289\n[ios]A typical news app benchmark with bottom ad banner by @hellohuanlin in 150991\nMake FittedBox not throw when child has zero size. by @PurplePolyhedron in 150430\n[tool] make testUsingContext provide a Stdio (with hasTerminal unset) override by default by @andrewkolos in 151357\n[tool] Remove some usages of deprecated usage package by @andrewkolos in 151359\nAdd Semantics Property linkUrl by @mdebbar in 150639\ntestAdd tests for stepper.controls_builder.0.dart by @ValentinVignal in 150669\nRoll pub packages by @flutter-pub-roller-bot in 151492\nClean up leaky test. by @polina-c in 151131\nUpdate doc of SemanticsProperties.identifier by @mdebbar in 149915\nfix heading level absorption, diagnostics; add tests and an a11y use-case by @yjbanov in 151421\nMention not @-mentioning people in commit messages in tree hygiene by @Hixie in 151487\nAdd docImports for flutter_test references by @goderbauer in 151175\n[CupertinoActionSheet] Fix padding and font size of buttons by @dkwingsmt in 151199\ndoc imports for enum values by @goderbauer in 151548\nUse correct locale for CupertinoDatePicker weekday by @victorsanni in 151494\ndocimports for flutter_driver by @goderbauer in 151267\nReplaced {@tool snippet} with {@tool dartpad} in CupertinoTabController by @RamonFarizel in 151272\ndocimports for API samples by @goderbauer in 151606\nAdd link to design document archive by @loic-sharma in 151489\nRoll Switch.adaptive changes into CupertinoSwitch by @victorsanni in 149465\nRemove workaround for a bug in dart2wasm by @mkustermann in 151603\nAdd test for menu_anchor.2.dart by @ValentinVignal in 151399\n[macOS] support secure restorable state by default by @cbracken in 151605\nAdd support for inverting CircularNotchedRectangle to optionally be drawn on the bottom of a path by @arbaker2 in 151386\nAdd tests for curve2_d.0.dart by @ValentinVignal in 150984\nRoll pub packages by @flutter-pub-roller-bot in 151816\nUpdate Design-Documents.md by @sethladd in 151472\nAdd example for CupertinoCheckbox by @victorsanni in 151779\n[CupertinoActionSheet] Add haptic feedback by @dkwingsmt in 151420\n[CupertinoActionSheet] Support legacy buttons by @dkwingsmt in 151136\nRemove unnecessary parens in test by @srawlins in 151846\nRemove redundant assignment of geometry by @hgraceb in 151821\nMake CupertinoSlidingSegmentedControl type parameter non-null by @LongCatIsLooong in 151803\ndocs: Fix typo in data driven fixes test folder section by @rkishan516 in 151836\nConstrain CupertinoContextMenu animation to safe area  by @victorsanni in 1518