        title: "Release Notes 3.44.0",
        body: "title: Flutter 3.44.0 release notes\nshortTitle: 3.44.0 release notes\ndescription: Release notes for Flutter 3.44.0.\nskipTemplateRendering: true\n\nThis page has release notes for Flutter 3.44.\nWhat's changed\nFramework\n\n Add new motion accessibility features to iOS. by @ksokolovskyi in 178102\n Implementation of tooltip windows for win32 by @mattkae in 179147\n Make sure that an EditableText doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180457\n Merge widget_tester_leaks_free_test.dart into widget_tester_test.dart by @dkwingsmt in 180600\n Make sure that a Container doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180350\n Make sure that an Expansible doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180478\n Make sure that a CupertinoTabScaffold doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 179824\n Make sure that a FlutterLogo doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180617\n Make sure that a LongPressDraggable doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180408\n Migrate doc and code to use sendAnnounce by @chunhtai in 180776\n Add API sample and docs for Expansible widget by @gowsikraja in 180273\n Fix RawAutocomplete unmounted crash during async optionsBuilder by @augustocesarperin in 180824\n Manually roll test dependencies by @goderbauer in 180886\n Make sure that a DisplayFeatureSubScreen doesn't crash in 0x0 environ… by @ahmedsameha1 in 180357\n Make sure that a DragTarget doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180422\n Make sure that a FormField doesn't crash at 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180810\n Make sure that a Banner doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180254\n Make sure that an ErrorWidget doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180830\n Make sure that a FocusScope doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in 180715\n Add Flutter as a Swift Package dependency by @vashworth in 178931\n Update link to FlutterTest font generation scr